  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community-led biochar and circular bioeconomy for climate-resilient food systems in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with the Timor-Leste National Adaptation Plan and the Adaptation Fund Results Framework, this project aims to enhance adaptive capacity and reduce vulnerability of smallholder farmers through improved soil health and valorization of biomass waste, thereby increasing agricultural production, reducing postharvest loss, ensuring sustainable livelihoods, and green job opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
